<item><title>Mauritius approves 124-point blue economy strategy for 2026-2035</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-approves-124-point-blue-economy-strategy-for-2026-761f66/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-approves-124-point-blue-economy-strategy-for-2026-761f66/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>The Cabinet approved a decade-long plan covering ocean-linked industries, with a new council to coordinate its implementation across government.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 06:54:41 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" length="32856" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
