<item><title>Mauritius halves trailer Road Tax to Rs 10 500 and eases fitness checks</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-halves-trailer-road-tax-to-rs-10-500-and-eases-5da7c5/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-halves-trailer-road-tax-to-rs-10-500-and-eases-5da7c5/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>The Road Tax on trailers falls from Rs 21 500 to Rs 10 500, a cut of just over 51%, after a meeting between the transport minister and operators.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:55:28 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-halves-trailer-road-tax-to-rs-10-500-and-eases-5da7c5/share.jpg" length="44378" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-halves-trailer-road-tax-to-rs-10-500-and-eases-5da7c5/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
